  CVE-2026-27321|2026-02-20T04:15:58.187|2026-02-20T04:15:58.187|0.0|NONE|N/A|N/A|false|Rejected reason: Not used|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-27321
  CVE-2026-27320|2026-02-20T04:15:58.123|2026-02-20T04:15:58.123|0.0|NONE|N/A|N/A|false|Rejected reason: Not used|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-27320
  CVE-2026-27319|2026-02-20T04:15:58.063|2026-02-20T04:15:58.063|0.0|NONE|N/A|N/A|false|Rejected reason: Not used|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-27319
