  CVE-2026-20611|2026-02-11T23:16:04.747|2026-03-16T14:18:08.697|7.8|HIGH|CWE-125|N/A|false|An out-of-bounds access issue was addressed with improved bounds checking. This issue is fixed in watchOS 26.3, tvOS 26.3, macOS Tahoe 26.3, macOS Sonoma 14.8.4, macOS Sequoia 15.7.4, iOS 18.7.5 and iPadOS 18.7.5, visionOS 26.3, iOS 26.3 and iPadOS 26.3. Processing a maliciously crafted media file may lead to unexpected app termination or corrupt process memory.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-20611
