  CVE-2026-21514|2026-02-10T18:16:33.803|2026-02-11T15:47:04.413|7.8|HIGH|CWE-807|N/A|true|Reliance on untrusted inputs in a security decision in Microsoft Office Word allows an unauthorized attacker to bypass a security feature locally.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-21514
