  CVE-2026-21511|2026-02-10T18:16:33.337|2026-02-11T18:56:56.907|7.5|HIGH|CWE-502|N/A|false|Deserialization of untrusted data in Microsoft Office Outlook allows an unauthorized attacker to perform spoofing over a network.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-21511
